title: 'pallet-psm: credit the caller before debiting on mint and redeem'

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `mint` and `redeem` now credit the caller before they debit it, so that the caller's account
    stays alive for the whole call.

    The amounts, fees and the `Minted` and `Redeemed` events are unchanged.

crates:
- name: pallet-psm
  bump: patch
